  "",
  "### Choosing a policy",
  "- **Static assets** with hashed names can be cached for a year.",
  "  - Use `immutable` so the browser skips revalidation.",
  "  - Never reuse a hashed file name for new content.",
  "- **HTML pages** should revalidate on every visit.",
